  "narrative": {
    "text": "A screenshot of a graph-editor canvas showing two TransportActions in sequence. TransportAction 'Transport to Train' has a 'dropoffLocation' edge to PhysicalLocation 'Load Terminal #4'; TransportAction 'Train To Siding 341A' has a 'pickupLocation' edge to 'Load Terminal #4' and a 'dropoffLocation' edge to PhysicalLocation 'Siding 341A'. Each TransportAction has its own Relationship 'hasInput', 'hasOutput' and 'performedBy' nodes; BulkHardware 'Graphite' (gold) is reached by 'to' edges from those relationships and has a 'bulkQuantity' edge leaving the top of the view. 'Transport to Train' is performed by Organization 'Safe Trucking LTD', and 'Train To Siding 341A' by Organization 'KJ Trains LTD'. Two 'ResponsibilityChange...' nodes (truncated) carry 'previous', 'current' and 'responsibilityChangedOn' edges; one is expanded to show 'responsibilityCategory*' = 'ownership' and actionStartTime and actionEndTime fields with values beginning '2025-08-27'. A Relationship 'isLocatedAt' links PhysicalLocation 'Siding 341A' to Organization 'Carbon Graph Inc'.",
